# n8n execution policy

Canon: `Categories/n8n_execution_contract.md`. Helper: `scripts/n8n_executions.py`.

- One live execution per workflow. Wait until idle (`running`/`waiting`/`new`) before a new webhook or `n8n execute`.
- LLM/Merge-parallel batches: **chunk size ≤ 10**. Default smoke **5**. Never `batch_size=100`/`500` in one execution.
- Next chunk only after the previous execution is terminal.
- Stop executions stuck > 30 minutes before starting another run.
- No `* * * * *` crons that perform HTTP/LLM. Schedule wall-clock time or an explicit command.
- Do not enable error-workflow autoresume while the task runner is unhealthy.
